l2-tape uses, patches and builds the collector of hftbacktest
(https://github.com/nkaz001/hftbacktest, commit 5f3ec40b2afb764e0fea112f941ed85523ef4e88).
docker/collector.patch and docker/collector.Cargo.lock contain parts of it, and the
Docker image built from docker/collector.Dockerfile contains the patched collector.
